{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11106150","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11106150","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110615001:1":{"text":"이렇게 강한 적을 물리치다니...","source_cn":"能击败如此强敌——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643222A9BE9B3FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110615002:0":{"text":"그들이 정말 군가 축제의 우승을 거머쥐게 될까요? 그들에게 힘찬 박수를 보내주세요!","source_cn":"难道他们真的有机会摘取战歌节的桂冠？让我们以热烈的掌声...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33D6DA3BD10C99A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110615003:1":{"text":"좋았어! 너희는 나 샤키르를 상대할 자격이 충분해! 이런 전투라면 언제든 환영일세.","source_cn":"好！你们称得上是我沙奎尔的强敌！我喜欢这样的战斗。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37D1987F51E9BBAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110615004:1":{"text":"나의 전의가 불타오르기 시작했어. 역시 자네가 인정한 트라이브야. 시련이 다시금 나를 부르는군...","source_cn":"我的战意又燃起来了，不愧是你认可的蛮血。磨练再度召唤了我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5DBBFE734D109945","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110615005:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리의 대결은 다음으로 미뤄야겠어!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B9D903CBB21FA4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리의 대결은 다음으로 미뤄야겠어!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리의 대결은 다음으로 미뤄야겠어!","variant_male_record_index":"120528","variant_female_record_index":"120529","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1110615005":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리의 대결은 다음으로 미뤄야겠어!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，下一次，我们再交手！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2B9D903CBB21FA4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리의 대결은 다음으로 미뤄야겠어!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 우리의 대결은 다음으로 미뤄야겠어!","variant_male_record_index":"120528","variant_female_record_index":"120529","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110615006:0":{"text":"다음번엔 절대 지지 않겠어.","source_cn":"到时，我绝不会输。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8022D8B8B677E952","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110615008:1":{"text":"칼라의 친구 여러분! 석양 전투장 최고의 볼거리인...","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们！残阳武斗场最激动人心的表演赛——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCEF34F7725F7F1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110615009:1":{"text":"지난 축제의 우승과 준우승! 브루투스와 오우거 간의 대결이 곧 시작될 예정입니다!","source_cn":"上一届的冠亚军！布鲁特斯对阵奥格，即将开场！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3FE9346F9F1552","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110615010:1":{"text":"이거 좀 놔.","source_cn":"别拉着我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3C265CEF459B249","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110615011:1":{"text":"브루투스 님과 오우거의 대결이야! 경기도 없는데, 당연히 보러 가야지 않겠어?","source_cn":"那可是布鲁特斯大人打那个奥格的比赛诶！我们现在又没有赛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E50B069D756CAB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110615012:1":{"text":"안 간다고 하진 않았어. 좀 천천히 가면 안 돼?","source_cn":"没说不去。你就不能稍微慢点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C952F6027A747F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110615013:1":{"text":"사람이 많아서 천천히 가면 앞줄에 못 선다고! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 소렌, 바짝 따라와...!","source_cn":"人太多了！慢点就挤不到前排了！<style=stres...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x042F59D7561A4EB3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"사람이 많아서 천천히 가면 앞줄에 못 선다고! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 소렌, 바짝 따라와...!","female":"사람이 많아서 천천히 가면 앞줄에 못 선다고! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 소렌, 바짝 따라와...!","variant_male_record_index":"120538","variant_female_record_index":"120539","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110615014:1":{"text":"내 필살기인 구르기로 길을 트는 수밖에 없겠어!","source_cn":"我要使出滚团开路的绝招了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x449D7A21F3ABFB9B","variant_stat